# E6-D1-FOUNDATION campaign scope selector for .github/workflows/d1-merge-train.yml
# on the docs/replatform-program integration branch. Bump this file to re-trigger
# the live D1 lane (it is on the workflow's push path filter).
#   bounded    = E6F-03 networked smoke + E6F-05 topology network-denial (fast)
#   foundation = the full E6F-01..07 gate campaign (bounded + tests/d1/e6f-*.test.mjs)
AOA_D1_CAMPAIGN=foundation
# Re-trigger nonce: CLI-006 the execution-ownership seam. Tasks 2b/3/4/6 all land in
# server/src ONLY — the suppression seam at the adapter call site, the projector on the
# JOB-005 ingest hook, cancel routing across the five writers, and the outer-finally
# catch — and server/src is NOT on this lane's push path filter, so without this bump
# the live 2-replica D1 lane silently would not rebuild the control-plane image or
# exercise any of it. This bit DEP-009 already.
AOA_D1_RETRIGGER=dsk-001-lane-b-b6-device-credential-gate
# Second bump, and the reason is the trap itself: the FIRST bump proved the lane on
# 8324e434b, but the adversarial-review fixes that followed (H1 cancel-outcome
# routing, H2 guarded marker write, H3 issue-lock narrowing, M6 wake predicate,
# M4/M5 projector-loop hoist) are ALL server/src-only and therefore invisible to
# this lane's push path filter. A green D1 on the earlier SHA says nothing about
# the code that actually ships. Re-prove the live 2-replica topology on the final
# state.
#
# THIRD bump, same reason again: round 2 of the fix review (the fifth cancel
# writer honouring writeLegacyTerminal, and a fence revoke on marker-write
# failure) is once more server/src-only. The rule this keeps proving: bump AFTER
# the last server/src change, not once per ticket.

# DSK-001 Lane B / B6. The device-credential gate lands in packages/db (the fenced
# secret-resolve decision + its transaction) and server/src (the fixture bridge and the
# integration suites). NEITHER is on this lane's push path filter -- it covers
# docker/**, tests/d1/** and the compose/lib scripts -- so without this bump the live
# 2-replica lane would not rebuild the control-plane image and would exercise none of
# it. The same trap bit CLI-006 three times and DEP-009 once.
